        "id": 83536,
        "name": "Rabit",
        "username": "Rabit",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-12-04T17:14:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>\"Officially\", it's just one deck for each hero - the game isn't really meant to be played with multiples of a single hero's deck.</p>\n<p>Thematically, well… We all know <strong><em>I</em></strong> am in favor of <a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/finest-and-newest-legacy\">playing with multiple instances</a>, where it’s thematically appropriate.  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/sunglasses.png?v=9\" title=\":sunglasses:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":sunglasses:\"> &nbsp;You really have to come to agreement on how it’s going to work before going there, though.</p>",
        "post_number": 21,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:06:39.009Z",
