        "id": 83541,
        "name": "dragon2439",
        "username": "dragon2439",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dragon2439/{size}/2230_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-12-05T00:13:42.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Heckbringer\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/h/58956e/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Heckbringer:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>grim88 wrote:</b><br><blockquote>For sure one of the Bunker promos (and probably the newer as well) and Unity are differant entities.\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\n&nbsp; Unity I could go either way on... It's possible the golems made the promo card version, or it seems plausible she did that to herself and the promo is the same character from a later time. \n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The freedom six are those characters in a world where legacy has gone villain. My guess is golem unity is just unity that had to partially rebuild herself after a battle or Accident. A robot thinking it is her would not have her technomancy powers, nor human bones (given the incap side).</p>",
